      ]
    },
    "details": {
      "fullDescription": "As a reference for this test task, I was given an ad creative video for the game *[#1c74d6]Mob Control[/color]*. \n**[#f46e00]The task was divided into three parts:[/color]**\n1. Recreate the provided video as closely as possible _using only Unity Recorder (no After Effects or other post-production)_. I had to build similar gameplay and record a matching sequence.\n2. Analyze the market and find ways to improve the creative.\n3. Improve the creative again _using only Unity_ — [#df5dff]adding features[/color], [#7fd40d]graphics[/color], [#ffe75d]effects[/color], etc.\n\n**[#ff3636]The deadline was 5 days.[/color]**\n\nIt was an interesting task, but [#927f78]I failed on the creative side[/color]. My final version wasn’t addictive enough for the market. I think I could have done better.\n\n**[#00f8ff]Media:[/color]**\n1st video – original reference\n2nd video – my replica of the reference\n3rd video – my final creative",
      "role": "Solo Developer",
      "techStack": ["Unity", "C#", "Unity Recorder", "Unity Nav Mesh", "Particle System VFX"],
      "media": [
        { "type": "video", "src": "assets/projects/10_Voodoo-TestTask/Initial-Video-Reference_HandBraked.mp4" },
        { "type": "video", "src": "assets/projects/10_Voodoo-TestTask/My-Reference-Recap_HandBraked.mp4" },
        { "type": "video", "src": "assets/projects/10_Voodoo-TestTask/My-Final-Result_Handbraked.mp4" }
      ]
    }
  }
